# Project Name: Project Testing Phase

## Project Title
Implement Client Script & UI Policy - Incident

## Testing Objective
To verify that the Client Script and UI Policy work correctly
in the ServiceNow Incident form.

## Test Case 1 - Short Description

Test:
Open the Incident form and leave Short Description empty.

Expected Result:
Short Description should be mandatory.

## Test Case 2 - Critical Priority

Test:
Set Priority to Critical.

Expected Result:
Assignment Group and Assigned To should become mandatory.

## Test Case 3 - Normal Priority

Test:
Change Priority from Critical to another priority.

Expected Result:
Assignment Group and Assigned To should become optional.

## Test Case 4 - Form Validation

Test:
Enter all required Incident details and save the form.

Expected Result:
The Incident should be saved successfully.

## Test Result
All Client Script and UI Policy functions are tested
and working as expected.

## Conclusion
The testing phase verifies that the Incident Management
System performs the required functions correctly.
